OL,3,AMan arrested after woman, 80, set on
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after an
OL,7,F80-year-old woman is believed to have
OL,8,Fbeen set on fire outside her home,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FOfficers were called at about 12:45 GMT
OL,12,Fon Monday to reports Brenda Raymond had
OL,13,Fbeen found in a first-floor communal
OL,14,Farea in Caractacus Cottage View,
OL,15,FWatford.
OL,17,FHertfordshire Police said she sustained
OL,18,Flife-threatening injuries and was taken
OL,19,Fto hospital, where she remains in a
OL,20,Fcritical condition.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
